---
const problems = [
  'You earn well but your money is sitting in a savings account losing value to inflation every day.',
  'You hear about investing constantly but have no idea where to actually start or what is right for you.',
  'You have tried investing before and lost money or got confused and now you are nervous to try again.',
  'You do not know how to evaluate whether an opportunity is worth your money or a trap.',
  'The Nigerian market feels opaque and global investing feels out of reach.',
  'You keep waiting until you know enough but the right time never comes.',
]
---
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-black/50 mb-5">
      <span class="h-px w-6 bg-[#FFBD40]"></span>
      Why you need this
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl text-black">The problem is not that you do not want to invest. It is that no one has shown you how.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-black/60">
      Profitable investing is a skill not a personality trait, not a privilege and not luck. Regardless of your educational background or your previous experiences with money, you can build this skill. This masterclass is how.
    </p>
  </div>
  <ul class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {problems.map((p) => (
      <li class="rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-[#F8F7F5] p-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-black">
        <span class="mb-3 block h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-[#FFBD40]" aria-hidden></span>
        {p}
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
  <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
    <a href="#offer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#FFBD40] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-black hover:brightness-95 transition">
      Learn how to invest →
    </a>
    <p class="flex items-center text-xs text-black/40">One-time payment · NGN 20,000</p>
  </div>
</section>
